 r←Test_Input_Misc_027(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;parms;F;menubar;txt
⍝ Exercise "Input" with a multi-line label that is a URL.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 4⍴0
 txt←'This is the project page of the APLTree project:'
 txt,←'⋄<https://github.com/aplteam/apltreeutils>'
 txt,←'⋄Refer to this page for details.'
 defMat⍪←'URL' ''txt DT.Label

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.testMode←1
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat parms ⍬
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂0 0 255)∊n.URL.FCol
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0 600 0≢n.URL.FontObj.Weight
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0 1 0≢n.URL.FontObj.Underline
 →T.GoToTidyUp'https://'≢{⍺ ⍺⍺(⍴,⍺)↑⍵}1⊃n.URL.Caption
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ {}n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap
⍝Done
